\q2 \w and light|strong="H216"\w* \w will shine|strong="H5050"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w your ways|strong="H1870"\w*.
\q1 \v 29 \w When|strong="H3588"\w* \w men are brought low|strong="H8213"\w* \w and you say|strong="H559"\w*, ‘\w Lift them up|strong="H1466"\w*!’
\q2 \w then He will save|strong="H3467"\w* \w the lowly|strong="H7807"\w* \w . . .|strong="H5869"\w*.
\q1 \v 30 \w He will deliver [even]|strong="H4422"\w* \w [one who is] not|strong="H336"\w* \w innocent|strong="H5355"\w*,
\q2 \w rescuing him|strong="H4422"\w* \w through the cleanness|strong="H1252"\w* \w of your hands|strong="H3709"\w*.”
\c 23
\s1 Job Longs for God
\p \v 1 \w Then Job|strong="H347"\w* \w . . .|strong="H559"\w* \w answered|strong="H6030"\w*:
\q1 \v 2 “\w Even|strong="H1571"\w* \w today|strong="H3117"\w* \w my complaint|strong="H7879"\w* \w is bitter|strong="H4805"\w*.
\q2 \w His hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w is heavy|strong="H3513"\w* \w despite|strong="H5921"\w* \w my groaning|strong="H585"\w*.
\q1 \v 3 \w If only|strong="H4310"\w* \w . . .|strong="H5414"\w* \w I knew|strong="H3045"\w* \w where to find Him|strong="H4672"\w*,
\q2 \w so that I could go|strong="H935"\w* \w to|strong="H5704"\w* \w His seat|strong="H8499"\w*.
\q1 \v 4 \w I would plead|strong="H6186"\w* \w my case|strong="H4941"\w* \w before Him|strong="H6440"\w*
\q2 \w and fill my mouth|strong="H6310"\w* \w with|strong="H4390"\w* \w arguments|strong="H8433"\w*.
\q1 \v 5 \w I would learn|strong="H3045"\w* \w how|strong="H4405"\w* \w He would answer|strong="H6030"\w*,
\q2 \w and consider|strong="H995"\w* \w what|strong="H4100"\w* \w He would say|strong="H559"\w*.
\q1 \v 6 \w Would He contend|strong="H7378"\w* \w with me|strong="H5978"\w* \w in His great|strong="H7230"\w* \w power|strong="H3581"\w*?
\q2 \w No|strong="H3808"\w*, \w He|strong="H1931"\w* \w would certainly|strong="H389"\w* \w take [note]|strong="H7760"\w* of me.
\q1 \v 7 \w Then|strong="H8033"\w* \w an upright man|strong="H3477"\w* \w could reason|strong="H3198"\w* \w with Him|strong="H5973"\w*,
\q2 \w and I would be delivered|strong="H6403"\w* \w forever|strong="H5331"\w* \w from my Judge|strong="H8199"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 8 \w If|strong="H2005"\w* \w I go|strong="H1980"\w* \w east|strong="H6924"\w*, \w He is not there|strong="H369"\w*,
\q2 \w and if I go west|strong="H268"\w*, \w I cannot|strong="H3808"\w* \w find|strong="H995"\w* Him.
\q1 \v 9 \w When He is at work|strong="H6213"\w* \w in the north|strong="H8040"\w*, \w I cannot|strong="H3808"\w* \w behold [Him]|strong="H2372"\w*;
\q2 \w when He turns|strong="H5848"\w* \w to the south|strong="H3225"\w*, \w I cannot|strong="H3808"\w* \w see [Him]|strong="H7200"\w*.
\q1 \v 10 \w Yet|strong="H3588"\w* \w He knows|strong="H3045"\w* \w the way I have taken|strong="H1870"\w* \w . . .|strong="H5978"\w*;
\q2 \w when He has tested me|strong="H974"\w*, \w I will come forth|strong="H3318"\w* \w as gold|strong="H2091"\w*.
\q1 \v 11 \w My feet|strong="H7272"\w* \w have followed|strong="H270"\w* \w in His tracks|strong="H838"\w*;
\q2 \w I have kept|strong="H8104"\w* \w His way|strong="H1870"\w* \w without|strong="H3808"\w* \w turning aside|strong="H5186"\w*.
\q1 \v 12 \w I have not|strong="H3808"\w* \w departed|strong="H4185"\w* \w from the command|strong="H4687"\w* \w of His lips|strong="H8193"\w*;
\q2 \w I have treasured|strong="H6845"\w* \w the words|strong="H561"\w* \w of His mouth|strong="H6310"\w*
\q2 \w more than my daily bread|strong="H2706"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 13 \w But He is unchangeable|strong="H1931"\w* \w . . .|strong="H259"\w*, \w and who|strong="H4310"\w* \w can oppose Him|strong="H7725"\w*?
\q2 \w He does|strong="H6213"\w* \w what He|strong="H5315"\w* \w desires|strong="H183"\w*.
\q1 \v 14 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w He carries out|strong="H7999"\w* \w His decree against me|strong="H2706"\w*,
\q2 \w and He has|strong="H5973"\w* \w many|strong="H7227"\w* such plans.
\q1 \v 15 \w Therefore|strong="H5921"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3651"\w* \w I am terrified|strong="H926"\w* \w in His presence|strong="H6440"\w*;
\q2 \w when I consider this|strong="H995"\w*, \w I fear|strong="H6342"\w* \w Him|strong="H4480"\w*.
\q1 \v 16 \w God|strong="H410"\w* \w has made my heart|strong="H3820"\w* \w faint|strong="H7401"\w*;
\q2 \w the Almighty|strong="H7706"\w* \w has terrified me|strong="H926"\w*.
\q1 \v 17 \w Yet|strong="H3588"\w* \w I am not|strong="H3808"\w* \w silenced|strong="H6789"\w* \w by|strong="H6440"\w* \w the darkness|strong="H2822"\w*,
\q2 \w by the thick darkness|strong="H652"\w* \w that covers|strong="H3680"\w* \w my face|strong="H6440"\w*.[’’]
\c 24
\s1 Job: Judgment for the Wicked
\q1 \v 1 “\w Why|strong="H4069"\w* \w does the Almighty|strong="H7706"\w* \w not|strong="H3808"\w* \w reserve|strong="H6845"\w* \w times for judgment|strong="H6256"\w*?
\q2 \w Why may those who know Him|strong="H3045"\w* \w never|strong="H3808"\w* \w see|strong="H2372"\w* \w His days|strong="H3117"\w*?
\q1 \v 2 \w Men move|strong="H5381"\w* \w boundary stones|strong="H1367"\w*;
\q2 \w they pasture|strong="H7462"\w* \w stolen|strong="H1497"\w* \w flocks|strong="H5739"\w*.
\q1 \v 3 \w They drive away|strong="H5090"\w* \w the donkey|strong="H2543"\w* \w of the fatherless|strong="H3490"\w*
\q2 \w and take the widow’s|strong="H490"\w* \w ox|strong="H7794"\w* \w in pledge|strong="H2254"\w*.
\q1 \v 4 \w They push|strong="H5186"\w* \w the needy|strong="H34"\w* \w off the road|strong="H1870"\w*
\q2 \w and force all|strong="H3162"\w* \w the poor|strong="H6035"\w* \w of the land|strong="H776"\w* \w into hiding|strong="H2244"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 5 \w Indeed|strong="H2005"\w*, \w [like] wild donkeys|strong="H6501"\w* \w in the desert|strong="H4057"\w*,
\q2 \w the poor go|strong="H3318"\w* \w to work|strong="H6467"\w* \w foraging|strong="H7836"\w* \w for food|strong="H2964"\w*;
\q2 \w the wasteland|strong="H6160"\w* \w is food|strong="H3899"\w* \w for their children|strong="H5288"\w*.
\q1 \v 6 \w They gather|strong="H7114"\w* \w fodder|strong="H1098"\w* \w in the fields|strong="H7704"\w*
\q2 \w and glean|strong="H3953"\w* \w the vineyards|strong="H3754"\w* \w of the wicked|strong="H7563"\w*.
\q1 \v 7 \w Without|strong="H1097"\w* \w clothing|strong="H3830"\w*, \w they spend the night|strong="H3885"\w* \w naked|strong="H6174"\w*;
\q2 \w they have no|strong="H369"\w* \w covering|strong="H3682"\w* \w against the cold|strong="H7135"\w*.
\q1 \v 8 \w Drenched|strong="H7372"\w* \w by mountain|strong="H2022"\w* \w rains|strong="H2230"\w*,
\q2 \w they huddle|strong="H2263"\w* \w against the rocks|strong="H6697"\w* \w for want|strong="H1097"\w* \w of shelter|strong="H4268"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 9 \w The fatherless infant|strong="H3490"\w* \w is snatched|strong="H1497"\w* \w from the breast|strong="H7699"\w*;
\q2 \w the nursing child|strong="H5921"\w* \w of the poor|strong="H6041"\w* \w is seized for a debt|strong="H2254"\w*.
\q1 \v 10 \w Without|strong="H1097"\w* \w clothing|strong="H3830"\w*, \w they wander about|strong="H1980"\w* \w naked|strong="H6174"\w*.
\q2 \w They carry|strong="H5375"\w* \w the sheaves|strong="H6016"\w*, \w but still go hungry|strong="H7457"\w*.
\q1 \v 11 \w They crush olives|strong="H6671"\w* \w within|strong="H996"\w* \w their walls|strong="H7791"\w*;
\q2 \w they tread|strong="H1869"\w* \w the winepresses|strong="H3342"\w*, \w but go thirsty|strong="H6770"\w*.
\q1 \v 12 \w From the city|strong="H5892"\w*, \w men|strong="H4962"\w* \w groan|strong="H5008"\w*,
\q2 \w and the souls|strong="H5315"\w* \w of the wounded|strong="H2491"\w* \w cry out|strong="H7768"\w*,
\q2 \w yet God|strong="H433"\w* \w charges|strong="H7760"\w* \w no one|strong="H3808"\w* \w with wrongdoing|strong="H8604"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 13 \w Then there|strong="H1992"\w* \w are|strong="H1961"\w* \w those who rebel|strong="H4775"\w* \w against the light|strong="H216"\w*,
\q2 \w not|strong="H3808"\w* \w knowing|strong="H5234"\w* \w its ways|strong="H1870"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3808"\w* \w or staying|strong="H3427"\w* \w on its paths|strong="H5410"\w*.
\q1 \v 14 \w When daylight [is gone]|strong="H216"\w*, \w the murderer|strong="H7523"\w* \w rises|strong="H6965"\w*
\q2 \w to kill|strong="H6991"\w* \w the poor|strong="H6041"\w* \w and needy|strong="H34"\w*;
\q2 \w in the night|strong="H3915"\w* \w he is|strong="H1961"\w* \w like a thief|strong="H1590"\w*.
\q1 \v 15 \w The eye|strong="H5869"\w* \w of the adulterer|strong="H5003"\w* \w watches|strong="H8104"\w* \w for twilight|strong="H5399"\w*.
\q2 \w Thinking|strong="H559"\w*, ‘\w No|strong="H3808"\w* \w eye|strong="H5869"\w* \w will see me|strong="H7789"\w*,’ \w he covers|strong="H5643"\w* \w . . .|strong="H7760"\w* \w his face|strong="H6440"\w*.
\q1 \v 16 \w In the dark|strong="H2822"\w* \w they dig through|strong="H2864"\w* \w houses|strong="H1004"\w*;
\q2 \w by day|strong="H3119"\w* \w they shut themselves in|strong="H2856"\w*,
\q2 \w never|strong="H3808"\w* \w to experience|strong="H3045"\w* \w the light|strong="H216"\w*.
\q1 \v 17 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* to them, \w deep darkness|strong="H6757"\w* \w is their|strong="H3162"\w* \w morning|strong="H1242"\w*;
\q2 \w surely|strong="H3588"\w* \w they are friends with|strong="H5234"\w* \w the terrors|strong="H1091"\w* \w of darkness|strong="H6757"\w*!
\b 
\q1 \v 18 \w They|strong="H1931"\w* \w are but foam|strong="H7031"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w the surface|strong="H6440"\w* \w of the water|strong="H4325"\w*;
\q2 \w their portion|strong="H2513"\w* \w of the land|strong="H776"\w* \w is cursed|strong="H7043"\w*,
\q2 \w so that no one|strong="H3808"\w* \w turns|strong="H6437"\w* \w toward|strong="H1870"\w* \w their vineyards|strong="H3754"\w*.
\q1 \v 19 \w As drought|strong="H6723"\w* \w and|strong="H1571"\w* \w heat|strong="H2527"\w* \w consume|strong="H1497"\w* \w vvv|strong="H4325"\w* \w the melting snow|strong="H7950"\w*,
\q2 \w so Sheol|strong="H7585"\w* \w steals those who have sinned|strong="H2398"\w*.
\q1 \v 20 \w The womb|strong="H7358"\w* \w forgets them|strong="H7911"\w*;
\q2 \w the worm|strong="H7415"\w* \w feeds on them|strong="H4985"\w*;
\q1 \w they are remembered|strong="H2142"\w* \w no|strong="H3808"\w* \w more|strong="H5750"\w*.
\q2 \w So injustice|strong="H5766"\w* \w is broken|strong="H7665"\w* \w like a tree|strong="H6086"\w*.
\q1 \v 21 \w They prey|strong="H7462"\w* \w on the barren|strong="H6135"\w* \w and childless|strong="H3808"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3205"\w*,
\q2 \w and show no|strong="H3808"\w* \w kindness|strong="H3190"\w* \w to the widow|strong="H490"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 22 \w Yet by His power|strong="H3581"\w*, \w God drags away|strong="H4900"\w* \w the mighty|strong="H47"\w*;
\q2 \w though rising up|strong="H6965"\w*, \w they have no|strong="H3808"\w* \w assurance|strong="H539"\w* \w of life|strong="H2416"\w*.
\q1 \v 23 \w He gives|strong="H5414"\w* them \w a sense of security|strong="H983"\w* \w . . .|strong="H8172"\w*,
\q2 \w but His eyes|strong="H5869"\w* \w are on|strong="H5921"\w* \w their ways|strong="H1870"\w*.
\q1 \v 24 \w They are exalted|strong="H7426"\w* \w for a moment|strong="H4592"\w*,
\q2 \w then they are gone|strong="H369"\w*;
\q1 \w they are brought low|strong="H4355"\w* \w and gathered up|strong="H7092"\w* \w like all others|strong="H3605"\w*;
\q2 \w they are cut off|strong="H5243"\w* \w like heads|strong="H7218"\w* \w of grain|strong="H7641"\w*.
\q1 \v 25 \w If|strong="H518"\w* \w this is not so|strong="H3808"\w*, \w then|strong="H645"\w* \w who|strong="H4310"\w* \w can prove me a liar|strong="H3576"\w*
\q2 \w and reduce|strong="H7760"\w* \w my words|strong="H4405"\w* \w to nothing|strong="H408"\w*?”
\c 25
\s1 Bildad: Man Cannot Be Righteous
\p \v 1 \w Then Bildad|strong="H1085"\w* \w the Shuhite|strong="H7747"\w* \w . . .|strong="H559"\w* \w replied|strong="H6030"\w*:
\q1 \v 2 “\w Dominion|strong="H4910"\w* \w and awe|strong="H6343"\w* \w belong to [God]|strong="H5973"\w*;
\q2 \w He establishes|strong="H6213"\w* \w harmony|strong="H7965"\w* \w in the heights of heaven|strong="H4791"\w*.
\q1 \v 3 \w -|strong="H3426"\w* \w Can His troops|strong="H1416"\w* \w be numbered|strong="H4557"\w*?
\q2 \w On|strong="H5921"\w* \w whom|strong="H4310"\w* \w does His light|strong="H216"\w* \w not|strong="H3808"\w* \w rise|strong="H6965"\w*?
\q1 \v 4 \w How|strong="H4100"\w* \w then can a man|strong="H582"\w* \w be just|strong="H6663"\w* \w before|strong="H5973"\w* \w God|strong="H410"\w*?
\q2 \w How|strong="H4100"\w* \w can one born|strong="H3205"\w* \w of woman|strong="H802"\w* \w be pure|strong="H2135"\w*?
\q1 \v 5 \w If|strong="H2005"\w* \w even|strong="H5704"\w* \w the moon|strong="H3394"\w* \w does not|strong="H3808"\w* \w shine|strong="H166"\w*,
\q2 \w and the stars|strong="H3556"\w* \w are not|strong="H3808"\w* \w pure|strong="H2141"\w* \w in His sight|strong="H5869"\w*,
\q1 \v 6 \w how much less|strong="H637"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3588"\w* \w man|strong="H582"\w*, \w who is but a maggot|strong="H7415"\w*,
\q2 \w and the son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of man|strong="H120"\w*, \w who is but a worm|strong="H8438"\w*!”
\c 26
\s1 Job: Who Can Understand God’s Majesty?
\p \v 1 \w Then Job|strong="H347"\w* \w . . .|strong="H559"\w* \w answered|strong="H6030"\w*:
\q1 \v 2 “\w How|strong="H4100"\w* \w you have helped|strong="H5826"\w* \w the powerless|strong="H3808"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3581"\w*
\q2 \w [and] saved|strong="H3467"\w* \w the arm|strong="H2220"\w* \w that is feeble|strong="H3808"\w* \w . . .|strong="H5797"\w*!
\q1 \v 3 \w How|strong="H4100"\w* \w you have counseled|strong="H3289"\w* \w the unwise|strong="H3808"\w* \w . . .|strong="H2451"\w*
\q2 \w [and] provided|strong="H3045"\w* \w fully sound|strong="H7230"\w* \w insight|strong="H8454"\w*!
\q1 \v 4 \w To|strong="H853"\w* \w whom|strong="H4310"\w* \w have you uttered|strong="H5046"\w* \w these words|strong="H4405"\w*?
\q2 \w And whose|strong="H4310"\w* \w spirit|strong="H5397"\w* \w spoke|strong="H3318"\w* \w through you|strong="H4480"\w*?
\b 
\q1 \v 5 \w The dead|strong="H7496"\w* \w tremble|strong="H2342"\w* —
\q2 \w those beneath|strong="H8478"\w* \w the waters|strong="H4325"\w* \w and those who dwell in them|strong="H7931"\w*.
\q1 \v 6 \w Sheol|strong="H7585"\w* \w is naked|strong="H6174"\w* \w before [God]|strong="H5048"\w*,
\q2 \w and Abaddon|strong="H11"\w*\f + \fr 26:6 \fqa Abaddon \ft means \fqa Destruction\ft .\f* \w has no|strong="H369"\w* \w covering|strong="H3682"\w*.
\q1 \v 7 \w He stretches out|strong="H5186"\w* \w the north|strong="H6828"\w* \w over|strong="H5921"\w* \w empty space|strong="H8414"\w*;
\q2 \w He hangs|strong="H8518"\w* \w the earth|strong="H776"\w* \w upon|strong="H5921"\w* \w nothing|strong="H1097"\w* \w . . .|strong="H4100"\w*.
\q1 \v 8 \w He wraps up|strong="H6887"\w* \w the waters|strong="H4325"\w* \w in His clouds|strong="H5645"\w*,
\q2 \w yet the clouds|strong="H6051"\w* \w do not|strong="H3808"\w* \w burst|strong="H1234"\w* \w under their own weight|strong="H8478"\w*.
\q1 \v 9 \w He covers|strong="H270"\w* \w the face|strong="H6440"\w* \w of the full moon|strong="H3678"\w*,\f + \fr 26:9 \ft Or \fqa of His throne\f*
\q2 \w spreading|strong="H6576"\w* \w over it|strong="H5921"\w* \w His cloud|strong="H6051"\w*.
\q1 \v 10 \w He has inscribed|strong="H2328"\w* \w a horizon|strong="H2706"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w the face|strong="H6440"\w* \w of the waters|strong="H4325"\w*
\q2 \w at|strong="H5704"\w* \w the boundary|strong="H8503"\w* \w between|strong="H5973"\w* \w light|strong="H216"\w* \w and darkness|strong="H2822"\w*.
\q1 \v 11 \w The foundations|strong="H5982"\w* \w of heaven|strong="H8064"\w* \w quake|strong="H7322"\w*,
\q2 \w astounded|strong="H8539"\w* \w at His rebuke|strong="H1606"\w*.
\q1 \v 12 \w By His power|strong="H3581"\w* \w He stirred|strong="H7280"\w*\f + \fr 26:12 \ft Or \fqa stilled\f* \w the sea|strong="H3220"\w*;
\q2 \w by His understanding|strong="H8394"\w* \w He shattered|strong="H4272"\w* \w Rahab|strong="H7294"\w*.
\q1 \v 13 \w By His breath|strong="H7307"\w* \w the skies|strong="H8064"\w* \w were cleared|strong="H8235"\w*;
\q2 \w His hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w pierced|strong="H2490"\w* \w the fleeing|strong="H1281"\w* \w serpent|strong="H5175"\w*.\f + \fr 26:13 \ft Hebrew \fqa nachash\ft ; translated in most cases as \fqa snake\f*
\q1 \v 14 \w Indeed|strong="H2005"\w*, \w these [are]|strong="H428"\w* \w but the fringes|strong="H7098"\w* \w of His ways|strong="H1870"\w*;
\q2 \w how|strong="H4100"\w* \w faint|strong="H8102"\w* \w is the whisper|strong="H1697"\w* \w we hear|strong="H8085"\w* of Him!
\q1 \w Who then|strong="H4310"\w* \w can understand|strong="H995"\w*
\q2 \w the thunder|strong="H7482"\w* \w of His power|strong="H1369"\w*?”
\c 27
\s1 Job Affirms His Integrity
\p \v 1 \w Job|strong="H347"\w* \w . . .|strong="H5375"\w* \w continued|strong="H3254"\w* \w his discourse|strong="H4912"\w* \w . . .|strong="H559"\w*:
\q1 \v 2 “\w As surely as God|strong="H410"\w* \w lives|strong="H2416"\w*, \w who has deprived me of|strong="H5493"\w* \w justice|strong="H4941"\w* —
\q2 \w the Almighty|strong="H7706"\w*, \w who has embittered|strong="H4843"\w* \w my soul|strong="H5315"\w* —
\q1 \v 3 \w as long as|strong="H5750"\w* \w my breath|strong="H5397"\w* \w is still|strong="H3605"\w* within me
\q2 \w and the breath|strong="H7307"\w* \w of God|strong="H433"\w* \w remains in my nostrils|strong="H639"\w* \w -|strong="H3588"\w*,
\q1 \v 4 \w my lips|strong="H8193"\w* \w will not|strong="H518"\w* \w speak|strong="H1696"\w* \w wickedness|strong="H5766"\w*,
\q2 \w and my tongue|strong="H3956"\w* \w will not|strong="H518"\w* \w utter|strong="H1897"\w* \w deceit|strong="H7423"\w*.
\q1 \v 5 \w I will never|strong="H2486"\w* \w -|strong="H518"\w* \w say that you are right|strong="H6663"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w*;
\q2 \w I will maintain|strong="H3808"\w* \w . . .|strong="H5493"\w* \w my integrity|strong="H8538"\w* \w . . .|strong="H4480"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w I die|strong="H1478"\w*.
\q1 \v 6 \w I will cling to|strong="H2388"\w* \w my righteousness|strong="H6666"\w* \w and never|strong="H3808"\w* \w let go|strong="H7503"\w*.
\q2 \w As long as I live|strong="H3117"\w*, \w my conscience|strong="H3824"\w* \w will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w accuse me|strong="H2778"\w*.
\s1 The Wicked Man’s Portion
\q1 \v 7 \w May my enemy|strong="H341"\w* \w be|strong="H1961"\w* \w like the wicked|strong="H7563"\w*
\q2 \w and my opponent|strong="H6965"\w* \w like the unjust|strong="H5767"\w*.
\q1 \v 8 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w what [is]|strong="H4100"\w* \w the hope|strong="H8615"\w* \w of the godless|strong="H2611"\w* \w when|strong="H3588"\w* \w he is cut off|strong="H1214"\w*,
\q2 \w when|strong="H3588"\w* \w God|strong="H433"\w* \w takes away|strong="H7953"\w* \w his life|strong="H5315"\w*?
